      "canonical_latex": "(G,\\cdot): (ab)c=a(bc),\\; \\exists e\\in G\\,(ae=ea=a),\\; \\forall a\\in G\\,\\exists a^{-1}\\in G\\,(aa^{-1}=a^{-1}a=e);\\quad \\phi(ab)=\\phi(a)\\phi(b),\\; \\ker\\phi=\\{g\\in G\\mid \\phi(g)=e_H\\},\\; G/\\ker\\phi\\cong\\operatorname{Im}\\phi",
